--- Str ---
trim='The quick brown fox' len=19 upper=THE QUICK BROWN FOX
contains fox=true indexOf quick=4 count o=2
starts 'The'=true ends 'fox'=true charAt(4)=113
substring=quick replace=The slow brown fox reverse=varg
split -> 4 parts, joined with '|': a|b||c
pad: [007] [ab...] repeat: =-=-=-=-
compare: true true true
--- Format ---
toInt=43 toLong=9000000000 toFloat=5
toBool=true toIntOr=-1 hex(255)=0xff
--- Math ---
sqrt(2)=1.41421 pow(2,8)=256 abs(-3.5)=3.5
floor/ceil/round(2.5)=2/3/3 pi=3.14159
sin(pi/2)=1 log(e)=1 max=7
--- Random ---
1000 dice rolls all in 1..6: true; nextFloat in [0,1): true
--- DateTime ---
year=2023 month=11 day=15 unix=1700049600
30 days later: 2023-12-15
--- Time / Stopwatch ---
slept at least 10ms: true; clock is past 2020: true
--- Path ---
basename=server.log dirname=/var/log/app ext=.log
join=usr/local/bin
--- File ---
exists=true size=34 lines=3 last='third line'
binary bytes=3
deleted: true
--- Process / OS ---
echo says: hello from the shell
exec exit code: 3
platform known: true cpus>0: true pid>0: true
env GRAV_DEMO=42 missing->default
--- IO & Term ---
IO.write has no newline... IO.print does
styled: [1mbold[0m [32mok[0m [31merr[0m
